0.14489571899012074, "y0": 0.11965811965811966, "x1": 0.7069154774972558, "y1": 0.13442113442113443}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.49066959385290887, "y0": 0.17404817404817405, "x1": 0.5203073545554336, "y1": 0.18414918414918416}, {"text": "Question 7 \u2014 Poetry (20 marks)", "x0": 0.145993413830955, "y0": 0.2066822066822067, "x1": 0.45773874862788144, "y1": 0.2222222222222222}, {"text": "\u201cA critical study of Gwen Harwood allows us to engage closely with the notion of", "x0": 0.14489571899012074, "y0": 0.2494172494172494, "x1": 0.8649835345773875, "y1": 0.2641802641802642}, {"text": "loss.\u201d", "x0": 0.14489571899012074, "y0": 0.26573426573426573, "x1": 0.19209659714599342, "y1": 0.27583527583527584}, {"text": "How does this represent your understanding of Gwen Harwood\u2019s poetry?", "x0": 0.14489571899012074, "y0": 0.289044289044289, "x1": 0.7530186608122942, "y1": 0.3038073038073038}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.49066959385290887, "y0": 0.34265734265734266, "x1": 0.5203073545554336, "y1": 0.35275835275835277}, {"text": "Question 8 \u2014 Nonfiction (20 marks)", "x0": 0.145993413830955, "y0": 0.37684537684537683, "x1": 0.4983534577387486, "y1": 0.3923853923853924}, {"text": "A critical study of these texts allows us to engage closely with the notion of loss.\u201d", "x0": 0.14050493962678376, "y0": 0.4087024087024087, "x1": 0.8254665203073546, "y1": 0.4296814296814297}, {"text": "How does this represent your understanding of at least TWO essays/speeches", "x0": 0.145993413830955, "y0": 0.43512043512043513, "x1": 0.7892425905598244, "y1": 0.44988344988344986}, {"text": "prescribed for study?", "x0": 0.14489571899012074, "y0": 0.45143745143745145, "x1": 0.3194291986827662, "y1": 0.4654234654234654}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.14489571899012074, "y0": 0.4840714840714841, "x1": 0.34796926454445665, "y1": 0.4972804972804973}, {"text": "+ George Orwell, George Orwell: Essays", "x0": 0.145993413830955, "y0": 0.5011655011655012, "x1": 0.4873765093304061