question in a SEPARATE booklet. Extra writing booklets are available.", "x0": 0.150384193194292, "y0": 0.16161616161616163, "x1": 0.8386388583973655, "y1": 0.17482517482517482}, {"text": "In your answer you will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.1350164654226125, "y0": 0.19425019425019424, "x1": 0.579582875960483, "y1": 0.20823620823620823}, {"text": "demonstrate understanding of and evaluate the relationship between", "x0": 0.19758507135016465, "y0": 0.21212121212121213, "x1": 0.7552140504939627, "y1": 0.2261072261072261}, {"text": "representation and meaning", "x0": 0.19758507135016465, "y0": 0.22843822843822845, "x1": 0.424807903402854, "y1": 0.24164724164724163}, {"text": "* organise, develop and express ideas using language appropriate to audience,", "x0": 0.16794731064763996, "y0": 0.2463092463092463, "x1": 0.8221734357848518, "y1": 0.2602952602952603}, {"text": "purpose and form", "x0": 0.19758507135016465, "y0": 0.26262626262626265, "x1": 0.3413830954994512, "y1": 0.27583527583527584}, {"text": "Question 11 \u2014 Elective 1: Conflicting Perspectives (20 marks)", "x0": 0.15148188803512624, "y0": 0.3162393162393162, "x1": 0.7628979143798024, "y1": 0.3317793317793318}, {"text": "\u201cThe construction of texts may represent multiple views, but these are rarely", "x0": 0.150384193194292, "y0": 0.34265734265734266, "x1": 0.7804610318331504, "y1": 0.3682983682983683}, {"text": "objective.\u201d", "x0": 0.150384193194292, "y0": 0.3667443667443667, "x1": 0.24039517014270034, "y1": 0.37995337995337997}, {"text": "Discuss this statement with reference to your prescribed text and ONE text of your", "x0": 0.150384193194292, "y0": 0.39937839937839936, "x1": 0.8309549945115258, "y1": 0.4133644133644134}, {"text": "own choosing.", "x0": 0.150384193194292, "y0": 0.4156954156954157, "x1": 0.2689352360043908, "y1": 0.4289044289044289}, {"text": "\u2018The prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.150384193194292, "y0": 0.4483294483294483, "x1": 0.35236004390779363, "y1": 0.46153846153846156}, {"text": "+ William Shakespeare, Julius Caesar", "x0": 0.15148188803512624, "y0": 0.46464646464646464, "x1": 0.4643249176728869, "y1": 0.47785547785547783}, {"text": "+ David Guterson, Snow Falling on Cedars", "x0": 0.15148188803512624, "y0": 0.48096348096348096, "x1": 0.5060373216245884, "y1": 0.494949494949495}, {"text": "+ Peter Whelan, The Herbal Bed", "x0": 0.15148188803512624, "y0": 0.4972804972804973, "x1": 0.41712403951701427, "y1": 0.5097125097125097}, {"text": "+ Barry Levinson, Wag the Dog", "x0": 0.15148188803512624, "y0": 0.5143745143745144, "x1": 0.411635565312843, "y1": 0.5275835275835276}, {"text": "* Ted Hughes, Birthday Letters", "x0": 0.15148188803512624, "y0": 0.5306915306915307, "x1": 0.4083424807903403, "y1": 0.5431235431235432}, {"text": "* Geoffrey Robertson, The Justice Game", "x0": 0.15148188803512624, "y0": 0.5470085470085471, "x1": 0.4862788144895719, "y1": 0.5594405594405595}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.49396267837541163, "y0": 0.5804195804195804, "x1": 0.5236004390779363, "y1": 0.5905205905205905}, {"text": "Question 12 \u2014 Elective 2: History and Memory (20 marks)", "x0": 0.150384193194292, "y0": 0.6130536130536131, "x1": 0.7310647639956093, "y1": 0.6293706293706294}, {"text": "\u201cThe construction of texts may represent multiple views of history and memory, but", "x0": 0.150384193194292, "y0": 0.6480186480186481, "x1": 0.8419319429198683, "y1": 0.662004662004662}, {"text": "these are rarely objective.\u201d", "x0": 0.150384193194292, "y0": 0.6643356643356644, "x1": 0.37102085620197583, "y1": 0.6775446775446775}, {"text": "Discuss this statement with reference to your prescribed text and ONE text of your", "x0": 0.150384193194292, "y0": 0.696969696969697, "x1": 0.8320526893523601, "y1": 0.710955710955711}, {"text": "own choosing.", "x0": 0.150384193194292, "y0": 0.7132867132867133, "x1": 0.2689352360043908, "y1": 0.7264957264957265}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.14928649835345773, "y0": 0.745920745920746